          "title": "Scene 4 \u2014 Complementary Bases & Hydrogen Bonds",
          "description": "Apply base\u2011pair rules: adenine pairs with thymine (2 hydrogen bonds), and guanine pairs with cytosine (3 hydrogen bonds). Visualize hydrogen bonds as dashed lines between paired bases."
